scapar puede que ya no sea una opción.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1279493","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:04:29.442Z"},{"id":"movie-1419406","slug":"movie-1419406","title":"Escuadrón letal","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ftBCLqEhDvgKRcux0fk5TriVhMD.jpg","synopsis":"Unos astutos y traicioneros ladrones desafian a la Policía Judicial de Macao. La Policía, que se encontraba en una dura batalla, invita de nuevo al experto en rastreo Huang De Zhong, retirado desde hace muchos años, a unir fuerzas con la joven élite del Departamento de Investigación Criminal de la Policía Judicial. Bajo la colisión de las técnicas tradicionales de rastreo y la alta tecnología, la policía y los criminales luchan con ingenio y valentía, y se lanzan a un duelo entre el bien y el mal parecido al juego del gato y el ratón.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Drama","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1419406","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:04:29.743Z"},{"id":"movie-1202033","slug":"movie-1202033","title":"Enola Holmes 3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cepT0wSQPvynDDYAM8tHjxa1Quk.jpg","synopsis":"Las aventuras de la detective Enola Holmes continúan en Malta, donde sus planes de boda se complican cuando Sherlock desaparece y ella se ve envuelta en un peligroso caso.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Crimen","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1202033","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:04:30.042Z"},{"id":"movie-1723967","slug":"movie-1723967","title":"The Leaching","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8xdLmP9ksISVyNg0kKUlI3DWtQg.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisode